# Track only marketplace files, plugins, and READMEs
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!README.zh.md
!.claude-plugin/
!.claude-plugin/**
!plugins/
!plugins/**
!docs/
!docs/**
# Re-ignore junk inside plugins/, which the allowlist above re-included.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
**/.pytest_cache/

# Downloaded ClinGen source artifacts (PDFs and supplements) are inputs to
# guideline generation, not tracked content.
**/ClinGen/
